cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  ioUS2MR-benchmark: a systematic benchmark of intraoperative
  ultrasound-to-MR synthesis for brain tumour surgery
message: >-
  If you use this software, the released model weights or the derived
  results, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper.
