repository-code: 'https://github.com/smcch/ious2mr-benchmark'
abstract: >-
  Code, configuration and trained model weights for a controlled
  benchmark of intraoperative ultrasound (ioUS) to MRI synthesis on the
  public ReMIND cohort: six generative architectures (Pix2Pix,
  SwinPix2Pix, CycleGAN, CUT, ResViT, SynDiff) x four inference regimes
  (2D, 2.5D, 2D+3D-refinement, full-3D) x two targets (T2w, T2w+FLAIR),
  evaluated with image-fidelity metrics and an nnU-Net downstream
  segmentation protocol.
keywords:
  - intraoperative ultrasound
  - MRI synthesis
  - brain tumour surgery
  - generative models
  - benchmark
  - ReMIND
